# Feature branch WIP → keep remote updated

When changing code on a feature branch (not `main`):

- After meaningful edits, **commit + push that branch** to origin.
- Goal: remote branch always has latest WIP so merging / pushing to **main** later is one clean step.
- Do **not** push or merge **main** unless the user explicitly asks.

Active hold-for-main preference: put WIP on `wip/next-month-main` (see `whatsapp-crm-feature-branch.mdc`).
